{"version":1,"_note":"信息源页海报专用(tools/banner/dyn_daily.py),组件不用。","actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cnd","value":"$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"},"_note":"国内默认判据:国内五城按国标分级,海外五城(末行北京作对照)按美国 EPA 分级。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ucn","value":"https://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality?current=pm2_5&timezone=auto&latitude=39.9042,31.2304,23.1291,30.5728,34.3416&longitude=116.4074,121.4737,113.2644,104.0668,108.9398"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"uov","value":"https://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality?current=pm2_5&timezone=auto&latitude=28.6139,51.5072,40.7128,-33.8688,39.9042&longitude=77.209,-0.1276,-74.006,151.2093,116.4074"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"url","value":"$[if::(eq::(${cnd},1),${ucn},${uov})]"}},{"action":"request","id":"resp","params":{"url":"${url}","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求屏障(勿删):request 之后紧邻的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_fail","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp}),4),0,1)]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"${_fail}"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"air_unreachable"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"at","value":"$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},HH:mm)]"},"_note":"接口的时间是各城当地时间,海报右上统一写取数时刻(本机时间)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_r0","value":"$[index::(${resp},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"r0","value":"${_r0.current.pm2_5}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"v0","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${r0},__n),__n),,parseNumber::(${r0},0))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"lv0","value":"$[if::(eq::(${cnd},1),if::(le::(${r0},35),0,if::(le::(${r0},75),1,if::(le::(${r0},115),2,if::(le::(${r0},150),3,if::(le::(${r0},250),4,5))))),if::(le::(${r0},9),0,if::(le::(${r0},35.4),1,if::(le::(${r0},55.4),2,if::(le::(${r0},125.4),3,if::(le::(${r0},225.4),4,5))))))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_m0","value":"$[min::(${r0},100)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_bw0",